### LOCAL
### NOTE: Customers/Quotations/Carriers/Ports all require an authenticated session.
### Open GET {{local}}/auth/github in a browser first (not via "Send Request"),
### then use a REST client that shares that browser's cookie jar, or copy the
### connect.sid cookie into a `Cookie` header below.

@local = http://localhost:5000

### GET the welcome / health check message
GET {{local}}/

### Start GitHub OAuth login (open in a browser)
GET {{local}}/auth/github

### GET the logged-in user
GET {{local}}/auth/user

### Log out
GET {{local}}/auth/logout

### --- Carriers ---

### GET all carriers
GET {{local}}/carriers

### CREATE a carrier
POST {{local}}/carriers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maersk",
  "scacCode": "MAEU",
  "contactEmail": "contact@maersk.com",
  "phone": "+45 33 63 33 63",
  "website": "https://www.maersk.com"
}

### --- Ports ---

### GET all ports
GET {{local}}/ports

### CREATE a port
POST {{local}}/ports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Puerto de Buenos Aires",
  "unlocode": "ARBUE",
  "country": "Argentina"
}

### --- Customers ---

### GET all customers
GET {{local}}/customers

### CREATE a customer
POST {{local}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Torres",
  "email": "ana.torres@example.com",
  "phone": "+54 11 5555-0100",
  "company": "Torres Import/Export S.A."
}

### --- Quotations ---

### GET all quotations
GET {{local}}/quotations

### GET quotations for a customer
GET {{local}}/quotations/customer/REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID

### CREATE a quotation
POST {{local}}/quotations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID",
  "carrierId": "REPLACE_WITH_CARRIER_ID",
  "origin": "Puerto de Buenos Aires",
  "destination": "Port of Rotterdam",
  "cargoType": "general",
  "weight": 12000,
  "volume": 28.5,
  "rate": 2450,
  "currency": "USD",
  "status": "draft",
  "validUntil": "2026-12-31"
}

### UPDATE only the status of a quotation
PUT {{local}}/quotations/REPLACE_WITH_QUOTATION_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "sent"
}

### DELETE a quotation
DELETE {{local}}/quotations/REPLACE_WITH_QUOTATION_ID


